{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/935318-art-direction-lately","id":935318,"title":"Art direction lately","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-21T15:58:01-07:00","id":935318,"title":"Art direction lately","content":"I just want to chime in and say after skimming through the MtAw 2e book, I thought &quot;well that's definitely the best-looking book from the CofD (2e) line, potentially the best from Onyx Path so far&quot;. Then, just yet, I did the same with Dark Eras, and oh boy! That's an exceptionally beautiful book, absolutely the best I saw for a long time! Part of it is my personal taste regarding artwork and especially artwork in a dark/horror rpg book, with which both books matched absolutely, but I think aside from that, the general quality of the arts are very high in both. <br /> <br /> So thanks OP, for the two beautific book, you earned a lot of brownie points from me, I can't wait to see how Beckett's Jyhad Diray will turn out!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If nothing worked, then let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk","name":"PM\u00e1rk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-21T16:11:32-07:00","id":935331,"title":"","content":"Thanks! I'll pass this along to Mike, who's responsible for all that pretty. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b